<title>AUSTRALIA: RTRS-Australian 13-week T-note yield falls.</title>
<headline>RTRS-Australian 13-week T-note yield falls.</headline>
<dateline>SYDNEY 1997-01-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Reserve Bank of Australia said the result of this week's T-note tender was as follows:</p>
<p> 5-week  -    Amount	Av. yield   Range	 Previous</p>
<p>		  AS300 million   5.829	 5.81-5.83   5.870</p>
<p>		  (RBA take-up nil, pct allotted at top 95)</p>
<p> 13-week -    Amount	Av. yield   Range	 Previous</p>
<p>		  AS200 million   5.666	 5.61-5.67   5.807</p>
<p>		  (RBA take-up 100 million, pct allotted at top 46)</p>
<p> 26-week -    Amount	Av. yield   Range	 Previous</p>
<p>		  AS300 million   5.632	 5.53-5.64   5.788</p>
<p>		  (RBA take-up nil, pct allotted at top 56)</p>
<p>-- Sydney newsroom 61-2 9373-1800</p>
</text>
